a product that is \n          extremely formal and detailed. Dennis is\n              <br>\n              &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; a true team player and a pleasure to work with.\n             </font>\n             <span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial\">\n              \"\n             </span>\n            </p>\n            <p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin: 0 30\">\n             <font face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\">\n              &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; John D. \n          Byers - President\n             </font>\n            </p>\n            <p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin: 0 30\">\n             <font face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\">\n              &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Vigilant \n          Hose Company\n              <br>\n              &nbsp;\n             </font>\n            </p>\n            <p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin: 0 30\">\n             <b>\n              <span style=\"font-family: Arial\">\n               <font color=\"#5E79BB\" size=\"4\">\n                &nbsp;■\n               </font>\n               <font color=\"#003366\" size=\"4\">\n               </font>\n              </span>\n             </b>\n             <font size=\"2\">\n              <b>\n               <span style=\"font-family: Arial\">\n                \"\n               </span>\n              </b>\n             </font>\n             <font face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\">\n              When \n          we chose your company, your staff started meeting us right away and in \n          a short\n              <br>\n              &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; time came up with a plan that our entire \n          membership could agree upon.\"\n             </font>\n            </p>\n            <p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin: 0 30\">\n             <font face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\">\n              &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Christopher \n          DeHa